		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Surprise Battering Ram</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — A spring-loaded ram that smashes and shoves enemies back.</em></p><p><strong>2 Actions.</strong> Reach 2, Damage: STRd8 Force. On hit: Large and smaller targets are pushed 2 spaces away.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Target is Dazed, 2 turns.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You have advantage on saves to avoid being moved against your will.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls STRd8 Force; on hit the target is Dazed.</em></p><p><em>[M] Dazed lasts 2 turns; push a Large or smaller target 2 spaces.</em></p>",
